  "title": "Mechelle's Chocolate Cookies",
  "description": "Nutty and super chocolaty cookies that use three kinds of chocolate chips. If you love chocolate as much as I do you will love these cookies. Hope they last more than a day!!",
  "authors": [
    "Mechelle"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-10-17T16:29:51-04:00",
